(Data and provenance) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Twenty-one archival speech excerpts from Reagan, Kennedy and Obama are candidate references.) Tj T*
(Each has 12 deliberately modified variants: four operators at three strengths. The 273) Tj T*
(released WAVs include 252 digital variants. Audio is 16-kHz mono PCM16. Exact half-open edit) Tj T*
(intervals and source hashes are stored in the manifest and labels. All references are) Tj T*
(genuine archival speech crops; the altered versions are synthetic edits of those crops,) Tj T*
(never authentic mistakes by the speakers. RIGHTS.md lists per-source reuse evidence and) Tj T*
(limits. No Windows SAPI audio is included.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Train, validation and test are separated by speaker/source and whole passage family: Reagan) Tj T*
(130 clips, Kennedy 39, Obama 104. Different eras, microphones and venues are confounded with) Tj T*
(split. The 22 original recordings from four local participants are private development) Tj T*
(material with no recorded redistribution consent and are excluded from the public package.) Tj T*
(Their instructions are not verified acoustic ground truth.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Alignment and acoustic features) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Offline archival word alignment uses imported MFA TextGrids for all 273 clips. The 170) Tj T*
(review flags mean disagreement with an older automatic aligner over 100 ms; they are not) Tj T*
(verified MFA errors. No human boundary accuracy is known. A live take uses PocketSphinx) Tj T*
(forced alignment when installed, otherwise a bounded MFCC dynamic-time-warping transfer of) Tj T*
(the reference word times. The fallback abstains for duration outliers, collapsed words,) Tj T*
(nonmonotonic mappings or high normalized path cost. It cannot verify that the words were) Tj T*
(actually spoken; transcript entry and an explicit listener confirmation gate that feedback.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Frames use a 40-ms window and 20-ms hop. Measurements include log-FFT energy, 13 MFCCs,) Tj T*
(estimated F0 and relative pitch in semitones, RMS level, spectral centroid and zero-crossing) Tj T*
(rate. Per-word durations and energy are compared at aligned word positions; interword gap) Tj T*
(excess measures pauses. Uncertain alignment and microphone gain limit interpretation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
