(same-setup flag. It never reads a clip ID, flaw label, intended take or programmed edit) Tj T*
(interval. For word i, the duration ratio is take duration/reference duration; the level) Tj T*
(difference is 10 log10\(mean take frame power/mean reference frame power\). For adjacent) Tj T*
(words, pause excess is take interword gap minus nonnegative reference gap. Threshold) Tj T*
(crossings generate word or gap intervals, and same-type neighbors within 120 ms merge.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Event | Train-selected threshold | Cause shown in dashboard) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Pause | Gap excess >=0.25 s | Seconds longer than reference gap) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Quiet local level | Clip-relative difference <-6 dB | Within-clip word energy change) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Rush | Tempo-normalized duration ratio <0.82 | Locally shorter word duration) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Drag | Tempo-normalized duration ratio >1.22 | Locally longer word duration) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The duration ratio is divided by the pair's median word-duration ratio, and word level) Tj T*
(change is centered by each clip's median energy. This reduces uniform speaker-rate and gain) Tj T*
(differences while retaining localized deviations. Uniform whole-clip changes are shown) Tj T*
(separately and cannot be localized by these rules. The four thresholds were selected by a) Tj T*
(144-point grid search on the Reagan training speaker, balancing overall event F1 and macro) Tj T*
(recall across flaw/severity groups at interval intersection-over-union \(IoU\) >=0.5. Kennedy) Tj T*
(and Obama were not used for threshold selection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Transparent rubric) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Three 0-10 operational dimensions cover pacing, pauses and local level. Merged events are) Tj T*
(scored by unique affected words with burden 1, 2 or 3 for minor, moderate or severe; this) Tj T*
(avoids multiplying a single displayed span by its number of word events. Pause score falls) Tj T*
(by 3 points per cumulative second of excess pause. The combined score is the mean of the) Tj T*
(three available dimensions. It is not a human preference score, speaking skill rating or) Tj T*
(MOS. Transcript or alignment failure withholds word-level measurements. Appropriate) Tj T*
(rhetorical pauses may be flagged.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
