(The detector has low precision, especially on Kennedy, and word-alignment errors can create) Tj T*
(misleading regions. Quiet events are only recorded-energy differences; automatic gain) Tj T*
(control and microphone changes can reverse their meaning. The same-reference archival) Tj T*
(variants are far easier than unrelated natural performances. There is no verified) Tj T*
(natural-speech accuracy, human severity calibration, independent transcript audit or) Tj T*
(measured word-boundary error. Do not present this as a reliable judge of people or public) Tj T*
(speakers.) Tj T*
